{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 28, :comments ["<b>He answered and sent His angel</b> — He is the fourth one, as in: \"The angel of YHWH encamps around those who fear Him.\" Likewise, \"He sent an angel and brought us out of Egypt,\" \"the angel of His presence saved them,\" \"the redeeming angel,\" \"the angel of Elohim set out.\" And I shall yet explain this to you most clearly."], :book :daniel, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Daniel - Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/daniel"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:19:40.984117591Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}